    "sections": {
        "description": "Plumbing Mechanic is a clean and practical theme designed for plumbing services, repair technicians, and maintenance professionals who need a clear online presence. It features a structured layout that helps present essential services such as pipe repair, leak detection, drainage work, and installation in an easy-to-navigate format. The design focuses on usability, allowing visitors to quickly understand your offerings and get in touch without confusion.Built with organized sections and a simple layout flow, it supports service listings, contact details, and informative content without adding unnecessary complexity. Customizable homepage areas allow you to adjust the layout to match your business needs, while maintaining a consistent and professional appearance. The responsive design ensures smooth performance across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices.Optimized for speed and clean code structure, the theme helps maintain fast loading times and reliable performance. It also works well with essential tools like contact forms and multilingual support. Plumbing Mechanic is suitable for independent plumbers, local repair businesses, and service providers looking for a straightforward and effective website solution."
    },
